The AdvancedEventMesh adapter enables SAP Integration Suite to connect toSAP Integration Suite,
advanced event mesh. Use the AdvancedEventMesh sender adapter to receive messages from SAP
Integration Suite, advanced event mesh. Use the AdvancedEventMesh receiver adapter to
send messages to SAP Integration Suite, advanced event mesh.
The adapter uses the Solace Message Format (SMF) message protocol.



